        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889600/extras/d016fc4ecef6334d79c4bad26e126b4d.avif?t=1779935488\" width=1290 height=415 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Plan your assault. Place your army. Breach the castle.</i></strong><br><br><strong>Gridfall</strong> is a tactical roguelike where every unit placement is a battlefield decision. Build deadly synergies using medieval troops and storm a grid-based frontline to conquer the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Tactical Placement Meets Combo-Building</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place your Units strategically to create unique combos on the battlefield. Deploy your Knights on the frontlines for extra power, hide Archers in the rear for maximum range, or unleash powerful combos by aligning formations and triggering tactical bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889600/extras/ba52d92da449a7f52c3b2082a41463b4.poster.avif?t=1779935488\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889600/extras/ba52d92da449a7f52c3b2082a41463b4.webm?t=1779935488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889600/extras/ba52d92da449a7f52c3b2082a41463b4.mp4?t=1779935488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Key Features</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place units on an expanding grid, where row multipliers and positioning can make or break your siege.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your &quot;army pool&quot; by recruiting new units, unlocking synergies, and drafting powerful loot after each round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 Battle Tactics, for you to transform the rules of war, buffing specific unit types or altering how formations behave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Armies, each with their own Units and playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 Fortune Cards, so you can fuse your Units with Arcane powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 Training Regimes, to improve your army with raw power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Tile Types, for your battle field to be unique and fit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889600/extras/311a0418682c7b08a9708a415131afb4.poster.avif?t=1779935488\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889600/extras/311a0418682c7b08a9708a415131afb4.webm?t=1779935488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889600/extras/311a0418682c7b08a9708a415131afb4.mp4?t=1779935488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Conquer the Grid, Rise the Banner</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a combo-crafter or a grid-optimizer, <i>Gridfall</i> is easy to learn, devilishly deep, and endlessly replayable. How will you storm the walls?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889600/extras/4e3417a4552009a5ccbbe169db0ca30a.avif?t=1779935488\" width=1290 height=350 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889600/extras/d016fc4ecef6334d79c4bad26e126b4d.avif?t=1779935488\" width=1290 height=415 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Plan your assault. Place your army. Breach the castle.</i></strong><br><br><strong>Gridfall</strong> is a tactical roguelike where every unit placement is a battlefield decision. Build deadly synergies using medieval troops and storm a grid-based frontline to conquer the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Tactical Placement Meets Combo-Building</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place your Units strategically to create unique combos on the battlefield. Deploy your Knights on the frontlines for extra power, hide Archers in the rear for maximum range, or unleash powerful combos by aligning formations and triggering tactical bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889600/extras/ba52d92da449a7f52c3b2082a41463b4.poster.avif?t=1779935488\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889600/extras/ba52d92da449a7f52c3b2082a41463b4.webm?t=1779935488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889600/extras/ba52d92da449a7f52c3b2082a41463b4.mp4?t=1779935488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Key Features</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place units on an expanding grid, where row multipliers and positioning can make or break your siege.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your &quot;army pool&quot; by recruiting new units, unlocking synergies, and drafting powerful loot after each round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 Battle Tactics, for you to transform the rules of war, buffing specific unit types or altering how formations behave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Armies, each with their own Units and playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 Fortune Cards, so you can fuse your Units with Arcane powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 Training Regimes, to improve your army with raw power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Tile Types, for your battle field to be unique and fit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889600/extras/311a0418682c7b08a9708a415131afb4.poster.avif?t=1779935488\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889600/extras/311a0418682c7b08a9708a415131afb4.webm?t=1779935488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889600/extras/311a0418682c7b08a9708a415131afb4.mp4?t=1779935488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Conquer the Grid, Rise the Banner</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a combo-crafter or a grid-optimizer, <i>Gridfall</i> is easy to learn, devilishly deep, and endlessly replayable. How will you storm the walls?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889600/extras/4e3417a4552009a5ccbbe169db0ca30a.avif?t=1779935488\" width=1290 height=350 /></span></p>",
